WEBVTT

00:07:26.958 --> 00:07:30.018
where is that moment
where everything changes?

00:07:30.042 --> 00:07:31.708
And what is the outcome?

00:07:32.542 --> 00:07:35.934
Where is it different,
what is the takeaway?

00:07:35.958 --> 00:07:38.976
A good story also has three attributes,

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:42.809
the first being it is going to build
and release tension.

00:07:42.833 --> 00:07:45.268
So because our brains love to anticipate,

00:07:45.292 --> 00:07:48.809
a great story builds tension
by making you wonder:

00:07:48.833 --> 00:07:51.393
"Where is she going with this?"

00:07:51.417 --> 00:07:53.476
"What's happening next," right?

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:57.059
A good story keeps you,
keeps your attention going.

00:07:57.083 --> 00:07:59.976
And it releases it
by sharing something unexpected

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.726
and it does this over and over
throughout the story.